---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Luminex Star Technical Services" description="Privacy policy for Luminex Star Technical Services L.L.C. How we handle your data when you contact us via our website.">
  <section class="bg-charcoal py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h1 class="text-white mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container max-w-3xl">
      <div class="prose prose-lg text-slate space-y-6">
        <p>This privacy policy explains how Luminex Star Technical Services L.L.C ("we", "us", "our") collects and uses information submitted through this website.</p>

        <h2 class="text-ink">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you fill out our contact form, we collect your name, email address, phone number, selected service, and message content. This information is transmitted via Web3Forms and sent to our business email.</p>

        <h2 class="text-ink">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information you provide solely to respond to your enquiry, prepare quotations, and arrange site visits. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

        <h2 class="text-ink">Analytics</h2>
        <p>This website uses Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is a cookieless, privacy-first analytics service. No personal data is collected and no cookies are placed on your device for analytics purposes. No consent banner is required.</p>

        <h2 class="text-ink">Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain contact form submissions for the duration needed to respond to your enquiry and for our records. You may request deletion of your data at any time by contacting us at <a href="mailto:info@luminexstar.ae" class="text-gold hover:text-gold-soft transition-colors">info@luminexstar.ae</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="text-ink">Contact</h2>
        <p>For any questions about this privacy policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@luminexstar.ae" class="text-gold hover:text-gold-soft transition-colors">info@luminexstar.ae</a> or call <a href="tel:+971555855033" class="text-gold hover:text-gold-soft transition-colors">+971 55 585 5033</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
